From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:29:02 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Adapt Dogecoin Python consensus fixtures to current ABC
 interfaces

Maintenance adaptation of Tobias Doged lineage at 9690833b8b6709b7a7837bc397f0d04bf3b885d1: 47d01efeab (Python Scrypt), 6a73b31bdd (MAX_MONEY), f9a9a4bd01 (PoW and deterministic fixtures), cf5f71083c (AuxPoW), and their retained follow-up API refactors. Preserve current ABC integer serialization APIs and unsigned transaction versions rather than reverting to older struct-based serialization. Retain canonical Dogecoin genesis, chain ID, AuxPoW commitments and Scrypt solving. Python messages unit tests pass; runtime fixtures require subsequent native validation.

